        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thieving-heaven-inheritances",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Who the novel places in Medieval Antiquity.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Three hundred thousand years ago, that was the Medieval Antiquity Era. Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable, Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable, and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable appeared in succession during this era. A female Gu Immortal, Shui Ni, founded water path and built Spirit Affinity House in the same era.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_shui_ni",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Which paths those three created.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-founded-in-this-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Medieval Antiquity Era, Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable created wood path, Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable created theft path, and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable created luck path.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-founded-in-this-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_luck"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Long Hair Ancestor in this era beside the three Venerables.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "long-hair-ancestor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same succession sits three hundred thousand years ago. Long Hair Ancestor appears in this era as well, lived a long time as a hairy man, and worked with Thieving Heaven and Giant Sun.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
